5. Optional Enhancements

Log to External Systems

Use tools like Azure Monitor, Application Insights, or ELK Stack (Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana) for advanced log management and visualization.


Log Retention Policy

Set a retention policy to delete logs older than a certain period (e.g., 1 year):

DELETE FROM AuditLogs WHERE CreatedDate < DATEADD(YEAR, -1, GETDATE());

Custom Action Metadata

If you have complex actions, include additional metadata:

Example: For a role change, log the old and new roles:


await LogAuditAsync(
    userId: "some-user-id",
    action: "Role Change",
    description: "User role changed from 'User' to 'Admin'.",
    ipAddress: HttpContext.Connection.RemoteIpAddress?.ToString(),
    userAgent: HttpContext.Request.Headers["User-Agent"].ToString(),
    performedBy: "admin-id"
);

